message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PowerGridSim: Event-Driven Grid Simulation with Auto-Switching Decision System"
abstract: >-
  PowerGridSim is an event-driven power grid simulation platform built on
  VeraGrid. It enables researchers to model real-world grid disturbances
  (load changes, generator trips, line faults), automatically generate
  protection and reconfiguration rules, and visualize grid state evolution
  through interactive dashboards. The framework integrates probabilistic
  power flow, reinforcement learning, and topology-aware rule generation
  for distribution network automation research.
